  "details": "Udon InputJump event does not fire while Quick Menu is open.\nHow to reproduce:\n- Join the Hook Junkers world ( https://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_d3e5abc3-2464-4e2f-b3df-d8f1758bf74e )\n- Jump, then jump again while in the air. This causes a double-jump to trigger in mid-air (a gameplay element).\n- Open the quick menu on any hand\n- Jump, then jump again while in the air.\nObserved:\n- Double-jump does not happen\nExpected:\n- Double-jump should happen due to the InputJump event\nAdditional notes:\n- This has been tested to happen in other game worlds.",
